Alembic migrations for the Sunflower API.

The database URL is read from the ALEMBIC_DATABASE_URL environment variable in
env.py (the sync psycopg driver), never from alembic.ini.

  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add disease_symptoms"
  alembic upgrade head
  alembic downgrade -1

Every schema change ships a migration. create_all() is banned. Always verify a new
revision round-trips: upgrade head, downgrade base, upgrade head again.
